      "content": "it just feels different this time though. it's not just a setback. i've spent my entire adult life preparing for this specific path. i've built my whole identity around being this researcher. now that's gone. i feel like there's nothing left of me. like the person i was supposed to be died when that drive crashed. how am i supposed to exist in a world where i'm just... this empty failure?",
